SUMMARY:Cripping Art Holiday Market with DIYabled
DESCRIPTION:Asheville\, you don’t want to miss this one! Cripping Art is taking over The Mule at Devil’s Foot Beverage for a festive night of handmade art\, gifts\, and community.\n\nSkip the big box stores and shop local\, one-of-a-kind work straight from the artists who made it. \n\n\n\n November 29\n 5–8 PM\n\n\n\nThis market is disabled-led\, so accessibility is built into the event from the start\, not added as an afterthought.  Masks are suggested to help protect our immunocompromised friends and community members. \n\n\n\n\n\nCome support local artists and celebrate the season with us!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/cripping-art-holiday-market-with-diyabled/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends,Market
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cooler-images.arryved.com/devils-foot-beverage-company/900980274_18127637455898150_3763371868088688769_n.jpg?width=1080&height=1429
END:VEVENT
